Muon Tomography Unified

This repository contains new integration and calibration code and adapted code
from Muon-Tomography-AI, Copyright 2023 Lim Li Xin Jed & Qiu Ziming, licensed
under Apache License 2.0.

The PoCA and likelihood implementations are derived from the local muonTruck
research code at source revision 8393853a47e8654552a62d1886fb6766d637782f,
with local uncommitted changes present at import time. No license file was found
in that source repository. Redistribution outside the owner's environment
therefore requires the owner to confirm the applicable license.

All copied or adapted files are changed to integrate the methods behind a
shared data model, fixed 64^3 geometry, explicit units, and one output schema.
